      "text": "@work-leaf edit Implement capped as the minimum of value and limit, and add the private-previewed regression tests for below-limit, equal-limit, and above-limit behavior.\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: src/lib.rs\n@@\n-pub fn capped(value: u8, _limit: u8) -> u8 { value }\n+pub fn capped(value: u8, limit: u8) -> u8 { value.min(limit) }\n+\n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod tests {\n+    use super::capped;\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn returns_value_when_below_limit() {\n+        assert_eq!(capped(4, 9), 4);\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn returns_value_when_equal_to_limit() {\n+        assert_eq!(capped(7, 7), 7);\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn returns_limit_when_value_exceeds_limit() {\n+        assert_eq!(capped(12, 5), 5);\n+    }\n+}\n*** End Patch\n@work-leaf end"
